# Inspect before edit

Before adding routes, hooks, services, or docs:

1. Search for existing `Mode*`, `*Observability`, `queryKeys`, domain modules
2. Read authoritative doc in [docs/README.md](docs/README.md) — do not duplicate architecture
3. Prefer extending established patterns over parallel implementations

Completion records under `docs/superpowers/plans/` are **historical** — verify against code.
